d.webm?t=1752675435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292310/extras/a164e63dff25c259c5f3c76fc56d14bd.mp4?t=1752675435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Explore</strong> a unique fantasy universe with its species, factions, and characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plunder</strong> merchants, outposts, and convoys to loot valuable goods and artifacts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capture</strong> hostages to trade them for ransom or interrogate them for additional information. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smuggle</strong> illegal goods and commodities to make some extra gold. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control</strong> a space duck to scout asteroids and find hidden treasures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade</strong> your ship with powerful alien technologies and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level up</strong> your characters - each has their own skillset to contribute to the ship's arsenal.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong> treasure maps, ancient texts, and artifacts, and unlock secret levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn Reputation</strong> with different factions by completing their quests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help Pastafarians</strong> spread the gospel of the Flying Spaghetti Monster in the galaxy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gain Power-Ups</strong> from enemies, alien runes, or Flying Spaghetti Monster boons. <br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_